WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:05.650
Good products. Right connections. New possibilities. Welcome to Auronix Commerce.

00:06.450 --> 00:10.050
From sourcing and supplier partnerships to marketplace operations and distribution. One

00:10.050 --> 00:13.650
connected approach, from source to sale.

00:14.449 --> 00:17.550
Meet AIO, the Auronix assistant. Ask a question, explore your options,

00:17.550 --> 00:20.650
and find your next step.

00:21.449 --> 00:25.549
Choose AIO One for relaxed replies, AIO 2 for balanced explanations,

00:25.549 --> 00:29.649
or AIO 2 Fast for everyday questions.

00:30.449 --> 00:34.549
Go from a question to an action. Start applications, track progress,

00:34.549 --> 00:38.649
manage subscriptions, create support tickets, or update your profile.

00:39.450 --> 00:43.050
Enter your details, verify your email in a dedicated code box,

00:43.050 --> 00:46.650
and review the action before it is submitted.

00:47.450 --> 00:51.050
Keep useful work close. Search and rename conversations, pin important answers,

00:51.050 --> 00:54.650
and return to your account-synced chat history.

00:55.450 --> 00:59.050
Approved company documents give AIO relevant context. Supporting source links help

00:59.050 --> 01:02.650
you check where an answer comes from.

01:03.450 --> 01:06.549
Get topic-based support for applications, email and catalogs, with offline replies

01:06.549 --> 01:09.649
and escalation to the team.

01:10.450 --> 01:14.049
AI-assisted screening flags missing application details. Administrators review the information and

01:14.049 --> 01:17.649
make the approval decision.

01:18.450 --> 01:22.049
Track email delivery, retry failed messages, and alert administrators about verification,

01:22.049 --> 01:25.649
recovery and notification issues.

01:26.450 --> 01:29.549
Manage seller drafts, catalogs, application tracking and partner resources through a

01:29.549 --> 01:32.649
clearer workflow.

01:33.450 --> 01:36.049
Download a transcript PDF, or verify your email to receive a

01:36.049 --> 01:38.649
copy.

01:39.450 --> 01:42.549
See service status, planned maintenance, and incident updates on a dedicated

01:42.549 --> 01:45.649
public page.

01:46.450 --> 01:49.549
Shape the experience with reply tone, length, context, memory preferences, and

01:49.549 --> 01:52.649
theme controls. Work your way.

01:53.450 --> 01:56.549
Auronix Commerce. Strong relationships. New possibilities. Start your conversation at auronixcommerce

01:56.549 --> 01:59.649
dot com.
